WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.920 --> 00:00:03.299
(intense music)

00:00:03.299 --> 00:00:05.181
- [Narrator] Once a town of nearly 10,000,

00:00:05.181 --> 00:00:08.048
Bodie is located just
east of the Sierra Nevada

00:00:08.048 --> 00:00:10.465
mountain range in California.

00:00:12.428 --> 00:00:15.383
Established in 1859 as
a gold mining village,

00:00:15.383 --> 00:00:19.550
at its height, there were
nearly 2,000 buildings here.

00:00:20.689 --> 00:00:23.785
Now, 200 remain as this
town lies in a state

00:00:23.785 --> 00:00:25.285
of arrested decay.

00:00:27.084 --> 00:00:28.647
Bodie is one of the most well-preserved

00:00:28.647 --> 00:00:30.564
ghost towns in America.

